+### External Agent-Tool Evaluation
+
+Use `ruby scripts/SaneMaster.rb external_tools` before adopting agent-workflow tools from outside SaneProcess.
+
+The command is read-only and optional by design. It checks tools such as `cass`, `ubs`, `dcg`, `br`/`bv`, and `asb` only when they are already installed, records what their safe probe actually returned, and gives an adopt/watch/skip recommendation. Missing tools stay missing; SaneProcess must not turn third-party `curl | bash` installers into default setup. On non-Mini hosts, `external_tools` is strict Mini-first unless `--local` is passed explicitly.
