+### Privacy-Safe Analytics Standard
+
+SaneApps may use privacy-preserving aggregate analytics for business operations. Acceptable events include downloads, update checks, page views, app launches, free/pro launch mix, buy/download button clicks, purchase started/completed, license activations, crashes, and broad feature adoption.
